      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"letting the noise stop\"... i don't know. everything i do just makes the noise louder. if i take a vacation, i'm just thinking about the emails. if i sleep, i'm dreaming about the volatility. it's like there's no way to actually reach that quiet you're talking about. it feels like the only way to actually get any real peace is if everything just... ceased.",
